full=load('compressed-full-star-1536');accepted=full['hybrid']['compressed_pairs']/full['near_pairs'];matrixmax=max(v['matrix_relative_max'] for v in full['errors'].values());lines=[f"The compression-active 1,536-panel star test checked all four complete matrices. {accepted:.1%} of its near panel pairs were represented in accepted low-rank blocks; its largest relative maximum-entry difference was {matrixmax:.3g}. The small 512-panel gap, concentric and graded-square nodal cases accepted no low-rank blocks: those tests qualify partition/scatter and inherited integration, not compression of layered geometry.",'', 'The 2k/4k nodal cases also retained complete two-vector outputs and 16 exact reference rows for every operator. Against the streamed two-vector outputs over **all output rows**, the largest difference in the 4k nodal case was '+f"{max(next(x for x in summary['vector_pairs'] if x['candidate']=='large-star-4096-hybrid_nodal')['all_output_rows_random_difference'].values()):.3g}.",'', '### Complete discrete TE/TM checks','', '| Panels / polarization | Stream iterations (0°/47°) | Hybrid iterations | Stream GMRES s | Hybrid GMRES s | Maximum field difference vs dense |','|---|---|---|---:|---:|---:|']
